{"seq":3,"slug":"deployment-optimization","title":"部署优化策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/evaluation-and-deployment/deployment-optimization","wordCount":834,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"部署优化策略\">部署优化策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>微调模型的部署优化涵盖从模型压缩到推理加速的完整链路。目标是在保持微调效果的前提下，最大化推理吞吐量、最小化延迟和成本。现代 LLM 部署需要综合运用量化、批处理、KV Cache 优化和推理引擎选择等技术，构建高效的推理服务。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[微调模型] --&gt; B[量化压缩]&#10;    B --&gt; C[推理引擎]&#10;    C --&gt; D[服务化部署]&#10;    D --&gt; E[负载均衡]&#10;    B --&gt;|GPTQ/AWQ/GGUF| C&#10;    C --&gt;|vLLM/TGI/SGLang| D&#10;    D --&gt;|API Gateway| E\">graph LR\n    A[微调模型] --&gt; B[量化压缩]\n    B --&gt; C[推理引擎]\n    C --&gt; D[服务化部署]\n    D --&gt; E[负载均衡]\n    B --&gt;|GPTQ/AWQ/GGUF| C\n    C --&gt;|vLLM/TGI/SGLang| D\n    D --&gt;|API Gateway| E</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化层面</th>\n<th>技术手段</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>适用阶段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模型压缩</td>\n<td>GPTQ/AWQ 量化</td>\n<td>显存减少 2-4x</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>部署前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推理引擎</td>\n<td>vLLM/TGI</td>\n<td>吞吐量提升 2-10x</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>部署时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批处理</td>\n<td>Continuous Batching</td>\n<td>吞吐量提升 3-5x</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>部署时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KV Cache</td>\n<td>PagedAttention</td>\n<td>显存利用率提升</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>引擎内置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推测解码</td>\n<td>Speculative Decoding</td>\n<td>延迟降低 2-3x</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>需要草稿模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推理引擎选择\">推理引擎选择</h2><p>vLLM 是目前最流行的 LLM 推理引擎，其核心创新 PagedAttention 通过操作系统级的内存分页管理技术优化 KV Cache，显著提高了 GPU 显存利用率和推理吞吐量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from vllm import LLM, SamplingParams&#10;&#10;llm = LLM(&#10;    model=&quot;./fine-tuned-model&quot;,&#10;    quantization=&quot;awq&quot;,&#10;    tensor_parallel_size=2,&#10;    max_model_len=4096,&#10;    gpu_memory_utilization=0.9,&#10;    enable_prefix_caching=True,&#10;)&#10;&#10;sampling_params = SamplingParams(&#10;    temperature=0.7,&#10;    top_p=0.9,&#10;    max_tokens=512,&#10;    repetition_penalty=1.1,&#10;)&#10;&#10;prompts = [&quot;请解释什么是微调&quot;, &quot;如何选择 LoRA 的秩参数&quot;]&#10;outputs = llm.generate(prompts, sampling_params)&#10;for output in outputs:&#10;    print(output.outputs[0].text)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vllm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LLM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, SamplingParams</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">llm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LLM(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./fine-tuned-model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    quantization</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"awq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tensor_parallel_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    max_model_len</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    gpu_memory_utilization</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    enable_prefix_caching</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sampling_params </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SamplingParams(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    temperature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    top_p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    max_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    repetition_penalty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"请解释什么是微调\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"如何选择 LoRA 的秩参数\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">outputs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llm.generate(prompts, sampling_params)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> output </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outputs:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(output.outputs[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].text)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>推理引擎</th>\n<th>PagedAttention</th>\n<th>Continuous Batching</th>\n<th>量化支持</th>\n<th>多 GPU</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>vLLM</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>GPTQ/AWQ/FP8</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>最高吞吐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TGI</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>GPTQ/AWQ/BNB</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>HuggingFace 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SGLang</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>GPTQ/AWQ/FP8</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>结构化生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>llama.cpp</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>GGUF</td>\n<td>CPU+GPU</td>\n<td>轻量级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ollama</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>GGUF</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>本地部署</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"量化部署流程\">量化部署流程</h2><p>部署前的量化是降低推理成本的关键步骤。AWQ（Activation-aware Weight Quantization）在量化质量和推理速度之间取得了最佳平衡：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from awq import AutoAWQForCausalLM&#10;from transformers import AutoTokenizer&#10;&#10;model_path = &quot;./fine-tuned-model&quot;&#10;quant_path = &quot;./fine-tuned-model-awq&quot;&#10;&#10;model = AutoAWQForCausalLM.from_pretrained(model_path)&#10;tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_path)&#10;&#10;quant_config = {&#10;    &quot;zero_point&quot;: True,&#10;    &quot;q_group_size&quot;: 128,&#10;    &quot;w_bit&quot;: 4,&#10;    &quot;version&quot;: &quot;GEMM&quot;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;model.quantize(tokenizer, quant_config=quant_config)&#10;model.save_quantized(quant_path)&#10;tokenizer.save_pretrained(quant_path)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> awq </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoAWQForCausalLM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoTokenizer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model_path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"./fine-tuned-model\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">quant_path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"./fine-tuned-model-awq\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoAWQForCausalLM.from_pretrained(model_path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokenizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">quant_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"zero_point\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"q_group_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"w_bit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GEMM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.quantize(tokenizer, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">quant_config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">quant_config)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model.save_quantized(quant_path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokenizer.save_pretrained(quant_path)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于需要在消费级硬件上运行的场景，GGUF 格式配合 llama.cpp 是最常见的选择：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoTokenizer&#10;&#10;model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(&#10;    &quot;./fine-tuned-model&quot;,&#10;    torch_dtype=&quot;auto&quot;,&#10;    device_map=&quot;auto&quot;,&#10;)&#10;tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(&quot;./fine-tuned-model&quot;)&#10;&#10;model.push_to_hub(&quot;my-model-gguf&quot;, tokenizer=tokenizer)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-da