/span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    throughputRps: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    costPerMillionTokens: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.45</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"lora-适配器热切换\">LoRA 适配器热切换</h2><p>对于使用 LoRA 微调的模型，部署时可以保持基础模型常驻，动态加载和切换不同的 LoRA 适配器，实现多任务服务共享同一组 GPU：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from vllm import LLM, SamplingParams&#10;from vllm.lora.request import LoRARequest&#10;&#10;llm = LLM(&#10;    model=&quot;Qwen/Qwen3-8B&quot;,&#10;    enable_lora=True,&#10;    max_loras=4,&#10;    max_lora_rank=64,&#10;)&#10;&#10;lora_requests = {&#10;    &quot;code&quot;: LoRARequest(&quot;code-adapter&quot;, 1, &quot;./lora-code&quot;),&#10;    &quot;math&quot;: LoRARequest(&quot;math-adapter&quot;, 2, &quot;./lora-math&quot;),&#10;    &quot;chat&quot;: LoRARequest(&quot;chat-adapter&quot;, 3, &quot;./lora-chat&quot;),&#10;}&#10;&#10;outputs = llm.generate(&#10;    [&quot;请写一个快速排序&quot;],&#10;    SamplingParams(max_tokens=512),&#10;    lora_request=lora_requests[&quot;code&quot;],&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vllm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LLM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, SamplingParams</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vllm.lora.request </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LoRARequest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">llm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LLM(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Qwen/Qwen3-8B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    enable_lora</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    max_loras</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    max_lora_rank</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lora_requests </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: LoRARequest(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"code-adapter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./lora-code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"math\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: LoRARequest(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"math-adapter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./lora-math\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"chat\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: LoRARequest(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"chat-adapter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./lora-chat\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">outputs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llm.generate(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"请写一个快速排序\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    SamplingParams(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    lora_request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lora_requests[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部署模式</th>\n<th>显存占用</th>\n<th>切换延迟</th>\n<th>支持任务数</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LoRA 热切换</td>\n<td>基础模型 + N×适配器</td>\n<td>&lt;10 ms</td>\n<td>10-50</td>\n<td>多任务 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并部署</td>\n<td>完整模型 ×N</td>\n<td>模型加载时间</td>\n<td>2-5</td>\n<td>独立服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量切换</td>\n<td>基础模型 + 1 适配器</td>\n<td>~100 ms</td>\n<td>不限</td>\n<td>离线批处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>部署优化需要综合运用量化、推理引擎和服务化三层技术</li>\n<li>vLLM 的 PagedAttention 和 Continuous Batching 是当前最高效的推理方案</li>\n<li>AWQ 4-bit 量化在 GPU 推理场景中质量损失最小、速度最快</li>\n<li>GGUF 格式配合 llama.cpp 适合消费级硬件和边缘部署</li>\n<li>LoRA 适配器热切换允许多任务共享 GPU，显著降低部署成本</li>\n<li>生产部署需要完善的监控、自动扩缩容和成本控制机制</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>本文是部署主题的<strong>总览层</strong>：量化的算法机制与实操流程、推理服务的 API 与扩缩容工程细节，分别见同 hub 第五章的<a href=\"../../evaluation-deployment/quantization\">模型量化与压缩</a>与<a href=\"../../evaluation-deployment/model-serving\">模型服务化部署</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"部署优化策略","id":"部署优化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"推理引擎选择","id":"推理引擎选择"},{"level":2,"text":"量化部署流程","id":"量化部署流程"},{"level":2,"text":"服务化与扩缩容","id":"服务化与扩缩容"},{"level":2,"text":"LoRA 适配器热切换","id":"lora-适配器热切换"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"模型合并技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/evaluation-and-deployment/model-merging"},"next":{"title":"微调评估方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/evaluation-deployment/evaluation-methods"}}